  "lesson": {
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "meta": "交互解题 · 球面圆半径",
    "title": "在半径为 $1$ 的球面上有 $n+1$ 个半径相等的圆 $C_0,C_1,\\ldots,C_n$，且对任意 $i\\in\\{1,2,3,4,n\\}$，$C_i$ 与 $C_0$ 相切，$C_i$ 与 $C_{i+1}$ 相切，这里 $C_{n+1}=C_1$。这 $n+1$ 个圆的半径等于",
    "answerLabel": "圆的半径",
    "answers": [
      {
        "label": "$n+1$ 个等圆的半径",
        "value": "$\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{1}{4\\sin^{2}\\dfrac{\\pi}{n}}}$"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "等半径圆的极点",
      "content": "<p>球半径 $1$，小圆半径 $r$ 时，极点到小圆的球心角 $\\alpha=\\arcsin r$。$C_0$ 的极点放在北极，周围 $n$ 个等圆的极点在纬度 $2\\alpha$ 上成正 $n$ 边形，且相邻相切给出圆心角 $2\\alpha$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Axis",
        "Sphere_unit",
        "Point_Z",
        "Point_K0"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 3.6,
        "y": 4.02,
        "z": 3.6
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "球面正三角形",
      "content": "<p>三极点 $C_0,C_i,C_{i+1}$ 构成边长均为 $2\\alpha$ 的等边球面三角形，顶角 $\\dfrac{2\\pi}{n}$。余弦定理：</p>$$\\cos 2\\alpha=\\cos^{2}2\\alpha+\\sin^{2}2\\alpha\\cos\\dfrac{2\\pi}{n}.$$",
      "highlight": [
        "Point_Z",
        "Point_K0",
        "Point_K1",
        "Line_K0K1",
        "Sphere_unit"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 3.37,
        "y": 5.06,
        "z": 2.7
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "解出 $r$",
      "content": "<p>令 $x=\\cos 2\\alpha$，得 $x=\\dfrac{\\cos(2\\pi/n)}{1-\\cos(2\\pi/n)}$，从而</p>$$r^{2}=\\sin^{2}\\alpha=1-\\dfrac{1}{4\\sin^{2}(\\pi/n)}.$$<p>图中画出 $n=5$ 的情形。这 $n+1$ 个圆的半径等于 $\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{1}{4\\sin^{2}\\dfrac{\\pi}{n}}}$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Point_K0",
        "Point_K1",
        "Point_K2",
        "Point_K3",
        "Point_K4",
        "Sphere_unit"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 4.04,
        "y": 3.71,
        "z": 3.37
      }
    }
  ],
